From: AndroidEmu contributors
Subject: [PATCH] system: export graphics preflight to the embedding application

The app resolves this entry point before starting QEMU. Darwin's explicit
export list must retain it even though QEMU itself does not call it.
Keep this separate from 0005 so previously prepared checkouts can update.

SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later

--- a/system/qemu.symbols
+++ b/system/qemu.symbols
@@ -11,6 +11,7 @@
   qemu_init;
   qemu_main_loop;
   qemu_cleanup;
+  android51_host_prepare_graphics;
   bql_lock_impl;
   bql_unlock;
   g_assertion_message_expr;
